<title>KENYA: Reuters launches news service for E.Africa.</title>
<headline>Reuters launches news service for E.Africa.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reuters, the international news and information company, on Wednesday launched a domestic news service for East Africa, company executives said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Reuters MarketWatch will be the first service in Africa to use web technology to deliver live fundamental market data.</p>
<p>Its initial focus will be Kenya and Mauritius but expansion is projected in Uganda, Tanzania, the Seychelles and Ethiopia.</p>
<p>Reuters MarketWatch was inaugurated by Governor Micah Cheserem of the Central Bank of Kenya at a breakfast attended by leading business figures in the Kenyan capital Nairobi.</p>
<p>--Nairobi Newsroom ++254-2 330-261.</p>
